<div class="lesson-label">How to Read This</div>

<h3>Speed is not the same as leverage.</h3>

<p>
A fast pathway can still produce weak results if it creates
little evidence or few connections. A slower pathway can be
powerful if it creates assets that continue producing value.
</p>

<br>

<p>
For example, a project can become a portfolio piece.
A portfolio piece can become an interview conversation.
An interview can become employment.
Employment can produce experience.
Experience can unlock a better role.
</p>

