</div>

<div class="check">
<div class="checkbox"></div>
<div><strong>One skill pathway</strong> — a skill directly connected to target opportunities.</div>
</div>

<div class="check">
<div class="checkbox"></div>
<div><strong>One evidence pathway</strong> — projects, portfolio, case studies, measurable accomplishments.</div>
</div>

<div class="check">
<div class="checkbox"></div>
<div><strong>One relationship pathway</strong> — mentors, professionals, alumni, employers, communities.</div>
</div>

<div class="check">
<div class="checkbox"></div>
<div><strong>One experimental pathway</strong> — freelance work, small business, competitions, or projects.</div>
</div>

</div>

<br>

<p>
The purpose is not to make life more complicated.
It is to avoid having your entire future depend on a single
application, employer, credential, customer, or opportunity.
</p>

